| GitHub Actions workflows | `github-actions-generator` | `github-actions-validator` |
| GitLab CI pipelines | `gitlab-ci-generator` | `gitlab-ci-validator` |
| Helm charts | `helm-generator` | `helm-validator` |
| Jenkinsfiles | `jenkinsfile-generator` | `jenkinsfile-validator` |
| Kubernetes YAML manifests | `k8s-yaml-generator` | `k8s-yaml-validator` |
